cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DuetScreen, please cite the manuscript and the Zenodo dataset record."
title: DuetScreen
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-21
license: MIT
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Anonymous"
repository-code: "https://github.com/qiaosuheng/DuetScreen"
abstract: >-
  DuetScreen is a dual-space nucleotide and protein screening model for DNA sequences.
  It combines a partially adapted Nucleotide Transformer v3 encoder with a frozen ESM2-35M
  protein representation and a dual-stream downstream network.
keywords:
  - biosecurity
  - DNA screening
  - nucleotide transformer
  - protein language model
identifiers:
